      "text": "ARRANGEMENT STRUCTURE",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 40,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 50,
      "z": 5,
      "pinned": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl-6",
      "type": "note",
      "name": "Note",
      "text": "Section-by-section map: Intro (0:00–0:15) — sparse, filtered pad. Verse (0:15–0:45) — drums + bass enter. Build clear transitions between sections before adding detail.",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 100,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 170,
      "z": 6,
      "pinned": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl-7",
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Section",
      "text": "LYRICS / TOPLINE NOTES",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 290,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 50,
      "z": 7,
      "pinned": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl-8",
      "type": "note",
      "name": "Note",
      "text": "Lyric drafts, melody hums/voice-memo references, and theme/story notes if the track has vocals.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 350,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 170,
      "z": 8,
      "pinned": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl-9",
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Section",
      "text": "MIX REFERENCE TRACKS",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 290,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 50,
      "z": 9,
      "pinned": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl-10",
      "type": "note",
      "name": "Note",
      "text": "Professionally mixed/mastered tracks in the same genre, used as a loudness and tonal-balance reference during mixing.",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 350,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 170,
      "z": 10,
      "pinned": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl-11",
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Section",
      "text": "MIX CHECKLIST",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 290,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 50,
      "z": 11,
      "pinned": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl-12",
      "type": "note",
      "name": "Note",
      "text": "1. Levels balanced before any processing\n2. High-pass non-bass elements\n3. Check mix in mono\n4. Reference against mix-reference tracks\n5. Automate key transitions\n6. Leave headroom for mastering (~-6dB peak)",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 350,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 170,
      "z": 12,
      "pinned": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl-13",
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Section",
      "text": "MASTERING / DELIVERY",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 540,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 50,
      "z": 13,
      "pinned": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl-14",
      "type": "note",
      "name": "Note",
      "text": "Target loudness (LUFS) per platform (streaming vs. club vs. broadcast), file format/sample rate required, and metadata (ISRC, credits, artwork) needed for release.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 600,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 170,
      "z": 14,
      "pinned": false
